  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ac 103.01 Members and Officers. Pursuant to RSA 309-B:4, I(a) the board is composed of a total of 7 members who are residents of New Hampshire and have been appointed by the governor with the approval of the council. The membership includes 5 current CPAs, and 2 public members, all of whom meet the requirements of RSA 309-B:4, I(a).\n\nSource. #6901, eff 12-4-98; ss by #8810, INTERIM, eff 1-25-07, EXPIRED: 7-25-07\n\nNew. #9032, eff 11-21-07; ss by #10053, eff 1-1-12 (from Ac 102.01); ss by #10700, eff 11-1-14",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ac100-500.html"
